                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9758423c-3126-4ed8-b53c-2a32745526c5",
                        "entry_id": "a8c0f344-5cd2-33c3-8ca7-2ba9af8ce27e",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more leavy"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e89e6097-1412-47df-8f64-4f697dcc8f7b",
                        "entry_id": "a8c0f344-5cd2-33c3-8ca7-2ba9af8ce27e",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most leavy"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                        "entry_id": "a8c0f344-5cd2-33c3-8ca7-2ba9af8ce27e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of leafy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f80c7f52-fdb7-4c8d-986e-09e488d12f1c",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "Within the furthest end thereof there was a pleasant Bowre\nSo vaulted with the leauie trées the Sunne had there no powre:"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fee877da-0d3b-4687-8666-6e01f23862d1",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "Now neere enough:\nYour leauy Skreenes throw downe,\nAnd shew like those you are […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45c581c6-781e-47e3-8ed9-a971380697fc",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "Thus when devouring hatchet-men invade,\nWith sounding steel, the forest’s leavy head,\nThe mountains ring with their repeated strokes;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9d0dc99-959e-47cd-b257-57a0b7f2774f",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "Put a good bunch of leavy herbs, such as basil, marjoram, dill, tarragon and parsley into the blender or processor and process for a few moments until roughly chopped, then add the butter, garlic and seasoning and continue as above."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce846235-0813-4b4f-b879-ee82d267fa96",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "While painted rails give you the impression that you are crossing a bridge and winding paths provide coherence to the shade lover’s garden, where white painted ladies shelter in the leavy coolness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a111d50-1281-4617-98ee-09abae1c95b0",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "A low road ran off Queen Margaret Drive, where the BBC was situated, and alongside the leavy, tree-lined Botanic Gardens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dfb232c-1f60-495f-9151-36542a8a5b75",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "Folic acid is found in grains and certain dark green leavy vegetables."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a5c36b0-17a6-46b2-a2cc-166b6e26f84e",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "Antioxidant / Folate | Food source / Spinach, broccoli, curly kale, green cabbage and other green leavy vegetables"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee13dc61-c844-4fca-bf37-e97cc02081dd",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "Homing birds nesting in tall, leavy trees / In splendor performing their rare symphonies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c717506-2480-4e02-9c54-d7a2fa46a23a",
                                "sense_id": "33c4be7f-ad0c-3e0d-bd16-59324eefe43b",
                                "text": "I thought the canna needed sun but they’re rowed up head-high in the shade along the back fence like a tall line of leavy green soldiers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
